      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "OpenXR support is a prerequisite for this, VRChat needs to upgrade their Unity version past 2020 LTS to make that possible.\nUnity 2020 and newer also don't support the render pipeline VRChat is using, so they would need to switch that, causing A LOT of content to break. \nVRChat doesn't have the luxury of being able to update all the assets on their own like normal games.\nRec Room doesn't allow custom shaders, so it's not a problem for them.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
