      "value": "@{5ae9d03b710a630342fdf700|full_name}: Thank you for sharing this comment, this is all stuff I wasn't aware of but it makes a lot of sense. I'm guessing eventually it'll be necessary for VRC to upgrade past 2020 LTS. Would an OpenXR version of VRChat support, for example, running the game via Steam without SteamVR (say for example using the native Oculus SDK instead)?",
