      "value": "@{5fe1688c149d3c2965ccd775|full_name}: Oculus SDK was deprecated by Meta, gotta release OpenXR games on their store now.\nI see what you mean though, and yeah they could have one build to rule them all with OpenXR.\nBoth SteamVR and Oculus have native OpenXR support, after all.\nUnity's support for OpenXR is a bit lacking still though, missing some features.",
