      "value": "@{5ae9d03b710a630342fdf700|full_name}: how close are the quest and PC version tied together tho? like most assets, and resouces are different right? So wouldnt the quest version with its standard shaders be the perfect start to betatest openxr/newer unity?\n\nlike they could even make a PC Openxr version to troubleshoot shaders and other things by then, this would also be great for content creators and people with older hardware.\n\nI know that eventually youd want everything on one unity version but that should not be required for the start right?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
