      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62def27167455d44a13d5a25|full_name}: I think you underestimate how huge of a task an engine (and graphics pipeline) upgrade, VR API change and input system rewrite are.\n\nWith the input system change, there's also bound to be people complaining, same for Unity upgrade breaking all old content, and OpenXR implementations not being very polished yet. (Meta messed up thier implementation so grip input doesn't work sometimes)\n\nI'm betting we'll have to wait until 2024 for Pico support considering all the other stuff they are already working on.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
