      "value": "@{62dfa8a1c5479346a890e327|full_name}: They supported it before as well, now they just officially are up to the OpenXR 1.0 specification.\n\nConsidering the Virtual Desktop dev has released an OpenXR version for Pico but not Meta (for OpenXR bug reasons), Meta might not comply fully with OpenXR 1.0. xD\n\nEither way, VRChat needs to upgrade to a newer Unity version for OpenXR support, and probably rework the input system.\n\nLots of work, I'd expect over a year before we see any plans for it even. (Pico port that is, I AM expecting a word on Unity upgrade)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
